# Docker build context for packaging/docker/Dockerfile: only requirements.txt, mangalist/, packaging/docker/,
# the icon (packaging/icons/mangalist-512.png, the web GUI's icons) and the extension host's sources (extension-host/,
# built in the image's JDK stage; never its build outputs or Gradle caches) are needed.
**
!requirements.txt
!mangalist/
!packaging/docker/
!packaging/icons/mangalist-512.png
!extension-host/
extension-host/**/build/
extension-host/.gradle/
extension-host/**/.gradle/
extension-host/.data/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
